  "description": "Where does your bike take you? Sometimes it's about the destination, other times it's about how you get there. The Del Sol Soulville with it's classic twin top tube steel frame was designed with both in mind. A 650b wheel-set together with a Shimano Tourney 7-speed drive-train, mechanical disc brakes, a classic springer road saddle and color matched fenders will push all the style, performance and cycling relaxation you can handle.\nD-Street Cafe twin top tube steel urban frameset\nForged Alloy 3 Piece, bolt-on 38t chainring\nShimano Altus rear derailleur with Rapidfire Plus shifter and an 8-speed Shimano cassette\nComfort alloy handlebar with 180mm length quill stem\nSpringer comfort saddle\nDouble-wall Alloy rims with stainless steel spokes\nTektro Aires Mechanical Disc brakes\nFull coverage fenders",
